  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "Wが折り返し地点に到着しました。ここでは、\n『相方理解度クイズ』に挑戦してもらいます！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "司会"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_e:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "これも、俺たちなら簡単にクリアだろ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_e:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "だな。かるーく全問正解してやろうぜ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 悠介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_e:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……正解です！　さすがW、さすが双子、\nまたしても答えをピッタリ当ててしまいました！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "司会"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_e:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "へへ、トーゼン♪\n次の問題もバッチリ答えるぜ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 悠介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_e:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それでは……第4問！\n蒼井享介の嫌いな食べ物は！？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "司会"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_e:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はいはーい、ピーマン！　……あ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 悠介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_e:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……悠介、それ自分のだろ……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_e:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ご、ごめん、間違えたっ！\n今のナシ……にならない、よなぁ……くっそー！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 悠介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_e:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（なんだよ、全問正解するはずだったのに……）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_e:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それでは、第6問！　蒼井悠介の苦手なものは！？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "司会"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_e:step-31:text",
        "step_id": 31,
        "step_index": 30,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 30
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "お化けだよ。悠介は本当怖がりなんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_e:step-32:text",
        "step_id": 32,
        "step_index": 31,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 31
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "この前も、テレビで流れた\nホラー映画の予告で驚いてたしね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_e:step-35:text",
        "step_id": 35,
        "step_index": 34,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 34
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "享介なんて、いつまでたっても歯医者が苦手じゃん！\n行く時はいっつもビビッててさー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 悠介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_e:step-38:text",
        "step_id": 38,
        "step_index": 37,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 37
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "なっ……それ、言う必要ないだろ。\n今は悠介の苦手なものの話なんだから！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_e:step-39:text",
        "step_id": 39,
        "step_index": 38,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 41,
          "target_step_index": 38
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "先に余計なこと言ったの、享介だろ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 悠介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
